/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:252:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:253:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:254:- The grid is a table of framed panels separated by background rows/columns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:255:- The leftmost column gives one solid row-label color for each panel row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:256:- In each panel column, exactly one panel has a solid non-background interior,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:257:  while the other panels share the same mask drawn in one template color on
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:258:  the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:259:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:260:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:261:- For every panel column, find the row containing the solid interior swatch.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:262:- Rebuild one output panel using that row's left label as the frame color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:263:- Fill the repeated template mask with the swatch color and leave the mask
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:264:  background cells as background; separate rebuilt panels with one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:265:  background column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:266:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:267:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:268:The table encodes a colorized stencil per column: the solid panel supplies
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:269:the paint color and frame label, while the duplicate template panels supply
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:270:the shape mask.
