/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:276:Slide the non-square sprite to the square anchor and replace the anchor with the sprite's mirror image.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:277:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:278:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:279:- The background is the most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:280:- There is one 8-connected non-background sprite that is not a solid 2x2 square.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:281:- There is one solid 2x2 square anchor in another non-background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:282:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:283:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:284:- Move the sprite straight toward the anchor along their unique cardinal separation until it touches the anchor's near edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:285:- Reflect the moved sprite across that near edge and draw the reflected copy in the anchor color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:286:- Clear the original locations; the output keeps only the moved sprite and reflected anchor-color copy.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:287:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:288:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:289:- The 2x2 square marks the mirror line: its side facing the sprite becomes the contact edge for a two-color reflected pair.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:290:</description>
