/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:294:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:295:Project the framed periodic stripe pattern across the canvas and erase the unused frame cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:296:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:297:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:298:- A bg canvas with a one-cell-thick rectangular frame of one color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:299:- Inside the frame are two parallel full-interior marker bars of another color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:300:- A third color fills the region between the marker bars on periodically spaced rows or columns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:301:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:302:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:303:- Infer the periodic row or column mask from the third-color stripes inside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:304:- Paint the frame color along those full rows or columns, extended to the grid boundary.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:305:- Extend the marker bars across the full canvas and repaint the source-color stripe cells between them.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:306:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:307:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:308:- The outer frame is not preserved as a border; it supplies the color for the periodic stripes selected by the inner source pattern.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:309:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:310:</reference_puzzle>
