/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:313:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:314:Fill every lattice slot from the color assigned to that slot position by the other lattices.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:315:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:316:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:317:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:318:- The largest foreground color forms several one-pixel-thick rectangular lattice frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:319:- The frame lines divide each lattice into the same row-by-column set of rectangular slots; some slots already contain one non-frame color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:320:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:321:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:322:- Infer a color for each logical slot position from the colored slots across all lattice frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:323:- Repaint every slot interior in every lattice with the inferred color for its row/column position.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:324:- Keep the frame lines and all background outside frames unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:325:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:326:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:327:- Slot sizes vary by frame, but the complete color pattern is indexed by lattice slot position rather than by absolute pixel size or location.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:328:</description>
