/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:332:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:333:Pack the non-background rows from three separated panels into one panel, scanning panels right-to-left.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:334:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:335:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:336:- A rectangular grid contains three equal-size panels separated by two full-height divider columns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:337:- The background is the dominant color; divider pixels use a color that appears only in the divider columns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:338:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:339:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:340:- Read panels from right to left, and within each panel read rows from top to bottom.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:341:- Keep each row that contains any non-background pixel, discarding all-background rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:342:- Place the kept rows at the bottom of a single panel-shaped output, padding above with background rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:343:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:344:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:345:- The task is row packing: the divider columns mark independent panels, and only the occupied rows are moved.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:346:</description>
