/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:350:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:351:Compress the stacked colored bars into a compact ordered table with the control pixel on the selected row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:352:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:353:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:354:- A background grid contains several full-width colored bars from top to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:355:  bottom; the last bar is the base/separator color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:356:- Each non-base bar may have an aligned three-column comb motif below it,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:357:  alternating side-pair rows with solid rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:358:- A singleton control pixel sits away from the colored motifs.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:359:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:360:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:361:- Make one output row per non-base bar, preserving top-to-bottom order.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:362:- In that row, paint the bar color once for each solid three-pixel row in
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:363:  its motif, then paint the base-bar color in the separator column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:364:- The singleton control pixel sits immediately above the base bar. Among
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:365:  motifs whose open side-pair parity is compatible with that bottom row,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:366:  put the control pixel in the output row with the fewest solid rows; use
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:367:  horizontal distance to the motif center only to break count ties.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:368:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:369:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:370:- The vertical comb height is a count, while the control pixel is read by
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:371:  projecting it onto the center gap of compatible comb rows rather than by
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:372:  its vertical band alone.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:373:</description>
