/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:377:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:378:Recolor each side-marked multicolor object embedded in a monochrome panel to its marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:379:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:380:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:381:- Same-color 4-connected components form monochrome panel regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:382:- The bounding box of a panel may contain 4-connected non-panel-color objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:383:- A target object touches exactly one side of its panel bbox, and all of its
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:384:  pixels on that side have one marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:385:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:386:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:387:- For every target object, fill any panel-colored holes enclosed by the object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:388:- Recolor the object and filled holes to the side marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:389:- Leave all other pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:390:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:391:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:392:- A multicolor object's single contact side identifies both which object should
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:393:  be normalized and which color should replace it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/prompt.md:394:</description>
