/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:41:Render the filled-square object counts as compact nested stacks ordered by count rank.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:42:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:43:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:44:A large noisy grid has a dominant background, scattered non-square noise, and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:45:filled monochrome square objects. Each square side length has exactly one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:46:object color, and side lengths form consecutive sizes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:47:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:48:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:49:Ignore non-square components. If the lowest square in the scene is of the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:50:smallest side length, treat that one smallest square as a distractor and do
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:51:not count it. For count rank k from left to right, create one block from all
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:52:square sizes with at least k remaining objects; draw larger squares first and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:53:smaller squares over their upper-left corner, then append one background
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:54:separator column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:55:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:56:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:57:The output is a count histogram of square side lengths, but each histogram
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:58:slot is rendered as nested upper-left square masks using the side colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:59:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:60:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:61:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:62:  "type": "move_in_order",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:63:  "src": "filled monochrome square objects s, grouped by side length after ignoring non-square noise and the lowest square when it is smallest",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:64:  "dst": "left-to-right count-rank stack slots d",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:65:  "match_cond": "a side group s contributes to slot d_k iff count(s) >= k",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:66:  "transform": "draw each slot as nested upper-left square masks, larger sides first; append one bg separator column after every slot",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:67:  "grid_shape": "height is largest side + 1; width is sum of slot widths plus one separator per slot"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:68:}
