/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:85:Look up query glyphs in a reference table and mark whether they form a line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:86:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:87:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:88:- Teal background with two full-width pink separator rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:89:- Above the first separator is a query row of 5x5 glyph cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:90:- Between separators is a reference table of the same 5x5 cells; a glyph is
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:91:  identified by both its color and its 3x3 shape.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:92:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:93:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:94:- Green-fill the background inside every table cell whose glyph exactly
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:95:  appears in the query row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:96:- If the matched table cells form one complete row or one complete column,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:97:  also green-fill the query band and the bottom verdict band.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:98:- Otherwise leave the query band unchanged and fill the bottom verdict band red.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:99:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:100:Key insight: The bottom color is not a count; it is the yes/no answer to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:101:whether the queried glyphs align as a full row or column in the table.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:102:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:103:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:104:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:105:  "type": "move_to_match",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:106:  "src": "query glyph cells s above the first separator row",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:107:  "dst": "reference table glyph cells d between the separator rows",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:108:  "match_cond": "s and d have the same color and same 3x3 glyph shape within their 5x5 cell",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:109:  "transform": "green-fill the background inside each matched d cell; if all query glyphs match cells forming one complete table row or column, also green-fill the query band and bottom verdict band, otherwise fill only the bottom verdict band red"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:110:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/3.md:111:</annotation>
