/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:41:Recolor wall-separated background regions alternately, starting with grey in the lower-left region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:42:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:43:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:44:- The grid has one dominant background color and one foreground wall color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:45:- The wall pixels form one or more 4-connected one-cell-thick segments.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:46:- Each wall segment separates exactly two 4-connected background regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:47:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:48:- Keep all wall pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:49:- Label the 4-connected background regions and connect two labels when they
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:50:  touch opposite sides of the same wall segment.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:51:- Color the region containing the lower-left corner grey, then flip between
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:52:  grey and green across every wall adjacency.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:53:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:54:- The red walls define a bipartite map of regions; the lower-left background
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:55:  region fixes which side of the alternating coloring is grey.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:56:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:57:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:58:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:59:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:60:  "src": "4-connected orange background regions separated by red one-cell-thick wall segments",
