/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:115:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:116:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:117:- A dominant background contains one singleton marker pixel and one wall color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:118:- Wall pixels lie on several rows and form left/right limits around the marker column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:119:- Empty rows between the top and bottom wall rows are open horizontal passages.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:120:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:121:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:122:- On a wall row, paint background pixels between the nearest wall strictly
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:123:  left of the marker column and the nearest wall at or right of it; if only
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:124:  one side is present, paint from that wall to the opposite grid edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:125:- On empty rows between the top and bottom wall rows, paint the whole row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:126:- On empty rows outside the wall-row band, reuse the nearest end wall-row interval.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:127:- Preserve wall pixels and the original marker pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:128:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:129:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:130:- The wall color defines scanline limits relative to the marker column; the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:131:  marker color fills those implied horizontal spans rather than flood-filling
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:132:  through connected background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:133:</description>
