/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:253:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:254:The outside sprite is a miniature line/fill diagram for the frame interior,
