/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:282:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:283:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:284:- The grid has one background color and one foreground color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:285:- Each foreground row contains exactly two foreground pixels mirrored across the vertical center.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:286:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:287:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:288:- Find the foreground row pair(s) with the smallest horizontal gap between the two markers.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:289:- Fill every pixel between those two markers in each selected row with the foreground color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:290:- Leave all other pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:291:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:292:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:293:- Wider marker pairs are context; the closest marker pair(s) show the unresolved horizontal segment.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.md:294:</description>
