/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:43:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:44:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:45:- Exactly one grid corner contains a foreground control pixel; it gives the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:46:  corner from which the triangle is painted.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:47:- There is one unique largest 8-connected monochrome foreground object, the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:48:  motif that remains in the output; all other foreground pixels are controls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:49:- Every foreground component outside that motif is a singleton control pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:50:- The fill color is the unique control color that appears in at least two
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:51:  non-corner control pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:52:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:53:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:54:- Start from a blank background canvas and redraw only the largest motif.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:55:- Count the non-corner control pixels; that count is the triangle side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:56:- Paint the fill color on the right-triangle region where those two distances
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:57:  from the marked corner's edges sum to less than the side length.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:58:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:59:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:60:- The scattered singleton controls are counted into a compact triangular
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/5.md:61:  stack at the marked corner; only the largest motif is not part of the count.
