/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:44:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:45:- Black background with several axis-aligned colored line drawings.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:46:- The line drawings are damaged by scattered pixels of one non-background noise color and by overlaps with other drawings.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:47:- Each real drawing is a rectangular partitioned frame enclosing one or more background regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:48:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:49:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:50:- For each non-background color, reconstruct its horizontal and vertical wall segments from dense row/column evidence.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:51:- Count the 4-connected background regions fully enclosed by those reconstructed walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:52:- The color with no enclosed region is the noise/pad color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:53:- Sort drawing colors by enclosed-region count; equal counts are ordered by which reconstructed frame covers the other.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:54:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:55:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:56:- The scattered color is not an object; it only pads the histogram, while each true object's room count is stable after rectilinear wall reconstruction.
