/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:134:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:135:- The dominant background color forms one solid separator row and one solid
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:136:  separator column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:137:- The separator cross splits the grid into four equal rectangular corner regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:138:- Each corner region contains exactly one background-colored blank pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:139:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:140:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:141:- Count the non-background colors in each corner region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:142:- The completed region multiset is defined by the maximum observed count of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:143:  each color across the four regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:144:- Replace each region's blank pixel with the single color needed to match that
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:145:  completed multiset.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:146:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:147:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:148:- The separator color inside a corner region is a missing value marker; comparing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:149:  the four regions reveals the shared multiset without using numeric color order.
