/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:214:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:215:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:216:- Two bordered rectangles: source (multi-cell sprites) and destination (singleton markers).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:217:- Each sprite has an anchor pixel — its least-frequent color. Markers share these colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:218:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:219:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:220:- Match each destination marker to the source sprite with the same anchor color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:221:- Translate the sprite so its anchor overlaps the marker position.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:222:- Output is the destination rectangle, interior cleared before stamping.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:223:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:224:Key insight: The rarest color per sprite doubles as a template key and positioning anchor.
