/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:251:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:252:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:253:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:254:- bg = most common color; yellow pixels sit inside enclosed regions bounded by colored walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:255:- Border legends: small rectangles on the grid edge whose fill color C matches a region's border color. Each legend contains a center dot and an indicator dot encoding a direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:256:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:257:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:258:- For each enclosed region, identify its border color C and look up the legend with fill color C.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:259:- The direction from the legend's center dot to its indicator dot gives the slide direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:260:- All yellow pixels in that region slide in that direction, stacking against the far wall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:261:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:262:Key insight: Legend fill color links to region border color; the center→indicator offset encodes the movement vector.
