/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:335:Slide multi-color sprites to align their marker pixels with matching isolated border anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:336:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:337:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:338:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:339:- Multi-color sprites in the interior; each has a minority-color "marker" pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:340:- Isolated border pixels (non-bg with all 4-neighbors bg) act as anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:341:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:342:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:343:- Match each sprite to the border anchor sharing its marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:344:- Top/bottom-edge anchor (non-corner): slide sprite horizontally so marker column = anchor column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:345:- Left/right-edge anchor (or corner): slide sprite vertically so marker row = anchor row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:346:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/1.md:347:Key insight: The anchor's edge position determines the slide axis — top/bottom means horizontal, left/right (or corner) means vertical.
