/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:206:Draw the marker-colored route through the centers of all doors in the parallel wall maze.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:207:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:208:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:209:- The grid has a background, parallel full-span walls, one three-pixel door
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:210:  segment in each wall, and two marker pixels sharing a color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:211:- Walls are either all vertical or all horizontal, and the markers are on
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:212:  opposite outer sides of the wall set.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:213:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:214:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:215:- Keep the scene unchanged except for the route.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:216:- Visit the door centers in wall order from the upper/left marker side to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:217:  the lower/right marker side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:218:- In each corridor, draw an orthogonal path to the cell just before the next
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:219:  wall, move along that wall to the door center, cross the center, and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:220:  continue to the next corridor; after the last door, connect to the other
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:221:  marker.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:222:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/4.md:223:Key insight:
