/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:129:Recolor the row-wise passage indicated by wall pixels with the singleton marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:130:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:131:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:132:- A dominant background contains one singleton marker pixel and one wall color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:133:- Wall pixels lie on several rows and form left/right limits around the marker column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:134:- Empty rows between the top and bottom wall rows are open horizontal passages.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:135:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:136:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:137:- On a wall row, paint background pixels between the nearest wall strictly
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:138:  left of the marker column and the nearest wall at or right of it; if only
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:139:  one side is present, paint from that wall to the opposite grid edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:140:- On empty rows between the top and bottom wall rows, paint the whole row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:141:- On empty rows outside the wall-row band, reuse the nearest end wall-row interval.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:142:- Preserve wall pixels and the original marker pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:143:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:144:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:145:- The wall color defines scanline limits relative to the marker column; the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:146:  marker color fills those implied horizontal spans rather than flood-filling
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:147:  through connected background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:148:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1905177901.arc-codegen-similar/9/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:149:<annotation>
